# /sdlc — Agent SDLC Kit (Cloud fallback)

When the user message includes `/sdlc` or clearly requests the SDLC kit / ticket-to-PR pipeline, read and follow the workspace skill at `.cursor/skills/sdlc/SKILL.md` (or `skills/sdlc/SKILL.md` in this plugin repo).

Do not invent a parallel process. Execute the orchestrator pipeline defined in that skill:

1. Orchestrate (`workflow-orchestrator-routing`)
2. Business Analyst requirements pack
3. Architecture slice planner
4. Codebase context discovery
5. `AGENTS.md` maintenance (`agents-md-author`)
6. QA author / tests before implementation
7. Senior engineer implementation (`implementation-quality-loop`)
8. Validation / QA (`qa-acceptance-validator`)
9. Security + DevOps review when relevant
10. PR packaging — never merge without human approval

For execution-plan-only work, route to `execution-plan-author`, `execution-plan-dispatcher`, or `implementation-quality-loop` instead of the full pipeline.
